@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 마이갤러리 테스트용 로그인 - 200
# @name galleryLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mock-user-14@example.com",
  "password": "Mock1234!"
}

### 마이갤러리 보유 포토카드 목록 - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?limit=12
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 검색 및 필터 - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?keyword=시로키&grade=LEGENDARY&category=DIGIMON&limit=12
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 첫 페이지 - 200
# @name galleryFirstPage
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?limit=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 다음 페이지 - 200
# 위의 galleryFirstPage 요청을 먼저 실행해야 합니다.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?limit=1&cursor={{galleryFirstPage.response.body.$.nextCursor}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 잘못된 limit - 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?limit=13
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 잘못된 등급 - 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?grade=INVALID_GRADE
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 잘못된 cursor - 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships?cursor=invalid-id
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{galleryLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 마이갤러리 인증 없음 - 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/ownerships
Accept: application/json
